    "DialogTitle": "LA2",
    "DialogText": "Very well then. Our scanners (or what's left of them) have located several flat areas on the part of the landmass that you can realistically reach using this rocket, designated Landing Sites. You will get to pick one. If you want to bring teammates, make sure they get the same landing site as you. If they're with you right now, you can all just board the same rocket, up to 7 people at a time. If you plan on splitting up for whatever reason, have one person of every team consult me. To ready a new rocket, simply flick the switch twice more.",
